ive/vocative plural &#x20;(mīna, “fish”)</li><li><i>Lao script form of</i> mīnā, <i>which is</i> inflection of <i>ມີນະ</i>:## ablative singular## nominative/vocative plural &#x20;(mīna, “fish”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Noun</b></p><ol><li><i>Lao script form of</i> muni (“sage”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Noun</b></p><ol><li><i>Lao script form of</i> muninda (“chief of sages”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Noun</b></p><ol><li><i>Lao script form of</i> munindo, <i>which is</i> nominative singular of <i>ມຸນິນທະ</i> &#x20;(muninda, “chief of sages”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Pronoun</b></p><ol><li>(<i>relative</i>) <i>Lao script form of</i> ya (“who, which, that”)</li><li>(<i>relative</i>) <i>Lao script form of</i> ya (“which, that”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Pronoun</b></p><ol><li>(<i>relative</i>) <i>Lao script form of</i> ya (“who, which, that”)</li><li>(<i>relative</i>) <i>Lao script form of</i> ya (“which, that”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Conjunction</b></p><ol><li><i>Lao script form of</i> yadidaṃ (“i.e.”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Pronoun</b></p><ol><li><i>Lao script form of</i> yaṃ, accusative singular of <i>ຢະ</i> &#x20;(ya, “who (m)”)</li><li><i>Lao script form of</i> yaṃ, accusative singular of <i>ຢາ</i> &#x20;(yā, “who (f)”)</li><li><i>Lao script form of</i> yaṃ, nominative/accusative singular of <i>ຢະ</i> &#x20;(ya, “which”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Pronoun</b></p><ol><li><i>Thai script form of</i> yā (“who”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Noun</b></p><ol><li><i>Lao script form of</i> yuga (“pair; generation”)</li><li><i>Lao script form of</i> yuga (“yoke”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Pronoun</b></p><ol><li><i>Lao script form of</i> yaṃ, accusative singular of <i>ຢ</i> &#x20;(ya, “who, which, that”)</li><li><i>Lao script form of</i> yaṃ, accusative singular of <i>ຢາ</i> &#x20;(yā, “who, which, that”)</li><li><i>Lao script form of</i> yaṃ, nominative/accusative singular of <i>ຢ</