<h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Adjective</b></p><ol><li><i>Burmese script form of</i> tasmiṃ, <i>which is</i> locative singular masculine/neuter of <i>တ</i> &#x20;(ta, “that”)</li></ol><p><b>Pronoun</b></p><ol><li>(<i>demonstrative</i>) <i>Burmese script form of</i> tasmiṃ, <i>which is</i> locative singular of <i>တ</i> &#x20;(ta, “him, it”)</li><li>(<i>demonstrative</i>) <i>Burmese script form of</i> tasmiṃ, <i>which is</i> locative singular of <i>တ</i> &#x20;(ta, “it”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Adjective</b></p><ol><li>(<i>demonstrative</i>) <i>Burmese script form of</i> tā, nominative/accusative plural feminine of <i>တ</i> &#x20;(ta, “those”)</li></ol><p><b>Pronoun</b></p><ol><li>(<i>demonstrative</i>) <i>Burmese script form of</i> tā (“she”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Particle</b></p><ol><li><i>Burmese script form of</i> ti (“thus”)</li></ol><p><b>Numeral</b></p><ol><li><i>Burmese script form of</i> ti (“three”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Noun</b></p><ol><li><i>Burmese script form of</i> tejo, <i>which is</i> nominative/vocative/accusative singular of <i>တေဇသ်</i> &#x20;(tejas, “brilliance”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Adjective</b></p><ol><li>(<i>demonstrative</i>) <i>Burmese script form of</i> tesaṃ, which is masculine/neuter genitive/dative plural of <i>တ</i> &#x20;(ta, “those”)</li></ol><p><b>Pronoun</b></p><ol><li>(<i>demonstrative</i>) <i>Burmese script form of</i> tesaṃ, which is genitive/dative plural of <i>တ</i> &#x20;(ta, “them”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Adverb</b></p><ol><li><i>Burmese script form of</i> taṃ (“there”)</li><li><i>Burmese script form of</i> taṃ (“therefore”)</li></ol><p><b>Adjective</b></p><ol><li>(<i>demonstrative</i>) <i>Burmese script form of</i> taṃ, which is inflection of <i>တ</i>:## masculine/feminine accusative singular## neuter nominative/accusative singular &#x20;(ta, “that”)</li></ol><p><b>Pronoun</b></p><ol><li>(<i>demonstrative</i>) <i>Burmese script form of</i> taṃ, which is accusative singular of <i>တ</i> &#x20;(ta, “him, it”)</li><li>(<i>demonstrative</i>) <i>Burmese script form of</i> taṃ, which is feminine accusative singular of <i>တာ</i> &#x20;(tā, “her, it”)</li><li>(<i>demonstrative</i>) <i>Burmese script form of</i> taṃ, which is nominative/accusative singular of <i>တ</i> &#x20;(ta, “it”)</li><li><i>Burmese script form of</i> taṃ, which is accusative singular of <i>တွံ</i> &#x20;(tvaṃ, “you”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Pronoun</b></p><ol><li><i>Burmese script form of</i> tvaṃ ("you")</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Adjective</b></p><ol><li><i>Burmese script form of</i> tassa, <i>which is</i> genitive/dative singular masculine/neuter of <i>တ</i> &#x20;(ta, “that”)</li></ol><p><b>Pronoun</b></p><ol><li>(<i>demonstrative</i>) <i>Burmese script form of</i> tassa (“to him, to it, to that”), <i>which is</i> dative singular of <i>တ</i> &#x20;(ta, “he, it”)</li><li>(<i>demonstrative</i>) <i>Burmese script form of</i> tassa (“his, its, of that”), <i>which is</i> genitive singular of <i>တ</i> &#x20;(ta, “he, it”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Noun</b></p><ol><li><i>Burmese script form of</i> thi, vocative singular of <i>ထီ</i>&nbsp;/ <i>ထဳ</i> &#x20;(thī, “woman”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Noun</b></p><ol><li><i>Burmese script form of</i> thī (“woman”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Noun</b></p><ol><li><i>Burmese script form of</i> thusa (“husk”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Noun</b></p><ol><li><i>Burmese script form of</i> thuso, nominative singular of <i>ထုသ</i> &#x20;(thusa, “husk”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Proper Noun</b></p><ol><li><i>Burmese script form of</i> theravāda (“Theravada”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Proper Noun</b></p><ol><li><i>Burmese script form of</i> theravādo, <i>which is</i> nominative singular of <i>ထေရဝါဒ</i> &#x20;(theravāda, “Theravada”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Numeral</b></p><ol><li><i>Burmese script form of</i> dasama (“tenth”)</li></ol></html><h3>Pali</h3><p><b>Nou